(.95,-.95,.5),([.3,1],[-1,-.55],[.05,.95]),('No dependable survivor floor is depicted after the coercive takeover.','The selected route gives CHAR-les decisive autonomous authority.','Projected living-survivor scenario permits substitution and continued useful or imposed roles.'),
